# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets / Pages redirects.
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# 2026-05-10: humm/ → hum/ (URL slug converged with displayed brand "hum").
# Anyone who shared an old link, or anyone who hasn't yet updated their
# App Store Connect Marketing/Support/Privacy URLs, still lands on the
# right page. 301 = permanent so search engines update their indexes.
/humm/ /hum/ 301
/humm/* /hum/:splat 301
